{"availability":"available","full":"nao1215/truss","name":"truss","description":"Rust image toolkit for CLI, HTTP, and WASM with signed URLs, SSRF protection, and WebP/SVG support.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":10,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-06T01:30:40Z","updated":"2026-10-11T04:31:35Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nao1215.github.io/truss/","topics":["avif","cli","image-processing","image-proxy","openapi","rust","signed-url","ssrf-protection","wasm","webp"],"demo":"https://nao1215.github.io/truss/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.087Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.087Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.087Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.087Z","stars":10,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) [](Cargo.toml) [](","truss is an image transformation tool with a shared Rust core for a CLI, an HTTP server, and a browser/WASM build.","Use the CLI for local files and shell pipelines, run the server behind a CDN or reverse proxy, process files in the browser with @nao1215/truss-wasm, or sign public URLs from Node.js with @nao1215/truss-url-signer."],"features":["One Rust core across the CLI, the HTTP server, and the browser/WASM build.","Signed URLs, SSRF protections, and SVG sanitization are built in.","Supports JPEG, PNG, WebP, BMP, TIFF, and SVG, plus GIF as a decode-only input. AVIF is not supported.","Runs on Linux, macOS, and Windows.","CLI behavior is covered by atago, and the HTTP API by runn."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nao1215/truss/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c7cfc451d9ccd7c73d22d6af0e2cee301ff9f75ae566f6fed3f2a45ac1d85b4b","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.187Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.187Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) [](Cargo.toml) [](","sourceUrl":"https:/